<article class="about wrap-narrow">
  <p class="eyebrow">A small introduction</p>
  <h1>A place for<br><em>what catches.</em></h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>This is my personal commonplace book: a quiet shelf for the things that catch my attention and ask to be kept.</p>
    <p>Here you may find notes in Spanish or English, images, links, sounds, and files. There is no schedule and no need to read in order.</p>
    <p><em>Tzar: Everything</em> is a working title. Change this page whenever you feel like introducing yourself—or leave it just like this.</p>
  </div>
